# The drawing (an extension): the extrusion of path_extrude, File >
# Drawing Sheet shows the sheet's screen; the sheet goes to A2, the
# scale to 1:2, first angle, a title, a section of the top view and a
# detail of the front view; dimensioning with no edges selected says
# what to select; and File > Export > Drawing writes it.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
key x shift
menu View|Drawing Sheet...
tw
twmove 307 105
twdown L 307 105
twup L 307 105
twmove 325 145
twdown L 325 145
twup L 325 145
edit 1:2
twmove 172 165
twdown L 172 165
twup L 172 165
twmove 181 386
twdown L 181 386
twup L 181 386
edit PLATE
twmove 46 266
twdown L 46 266
twup L 46 266
edit top 0
twmove 46 306
twdown L 46 306
twup L 46 306
edit front -10 0 5 2
answer ok
twmove 46 376
twdown L 46 376
twup L 46 376
tw
file $tmp/sheet.svg
menu File|Export|Drawing (.pdf, .eps, .svg, .dxf, .plt, .ngc)...
save
